      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone currently making a world, the drone can be really easily used to completely ruin the experience and cheat especially due to the unlimited range. I want it off for a reason, I should be able to make sure it stays off.\n\nMaybe I want stickers off by default suggestion but don't care if someone wants to turn them on, that's completely fine by me. But if I want to disable something like the drone completely I should absolutely be able to do that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
