      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df1f0a67455d44a15a629a|full_name} I should have the final say what I can do in my own instance with my friends, its not a public place to need some weird random rules that only make my experience worse.\n\nYou can still control the public spaces to that trolls can't ruin the intended experience - and thats great. But in private instances there is no such risk, the only thing you can achieve is make people not want to use such world when its limited more than others for no reason.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
